The [[Cap of Resilience]] is an epic [[Helmet]] available in the shop for all classes. It reduces damage taken in the first few seconds of the battle, and gives resistance to critical hits and stuns.

There are two upgrades to the [[Cap of Resilience]]. Combining it with a [[Stone Skin Potion]] gives the [[Stone Helm]], which does mostly the same thing but is strictly enhanced. Combining the [[Cap of Resilience]] with a [[Corrupted Crystal]] gives the [[Cap of Discomfort]], which trades in the crit and stun resistance for opponent buff nullification and heal reduction, along with longer damage reduction at the start of the battle.

The [[Cap of Resilience]] is the most common item which satisfies the helmet condition for [[Full Body Protection]].
